==================== Configuration, validation and startup refusal ====================
  PASS  a complete AI-booking config validates
  PASS  missing placeholder address, payment type and cancellation reason are all reported for AI booking
  PASS  a handoff-only park needs only credentials
  PASS  unit_mode must be category or site
  PASS  the app refuses to start a real-NewBook AI-booking park with an incomplete config
  PASS  and starts when the config is complete
  PASS  mock-NewBook parks are not subject to REST validation
  PASS  missing credentials surface as a CONFIG error (and nothing is sent)
  PASS  creating a booking without a placeholder address is refused before any request
  PASS  hostile caller-supplied names travel as plain JSON data (no breakage)
  PASS  NewBookError carries code, method and outcomeUnknown

